  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information : </strong></span>Aadhar card by Unique Identification Authority of India UIDAI which citizens also know by the name of my Aadhaar, my identity. This is a unique ID card for all citizens living in India.&nbsp; </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">How to Download Aadhaar Card, how to update it, how to change mobile number in Aadhaar Card, update address in Aadhaar Card, how to make correction in Aadhaar Card, how to download Aadhaar Card from mobile. </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Those All The Interested People Checking Aadhaar Card Details all the information related to the Aadhaar Card, Registration is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 1.71233%;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UIDAI (Unique Identification Authority of India)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Aadhar Card PVC Download, Correction, Status 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 1.71233%;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Aadhar Card Scheme Launch : <strong>2009</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Enrollment Will be Begin : <strong>2009</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date for Enrollment in New Aadhar Card : <strong>As Per Schedule</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 1.71233%;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Biometric Update : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>100/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">PVC Card Order : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>50/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Demographic Update : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>50/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Aadhar Enrollment : <b>0/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Appointment Fees :&nbsp;<b>0/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Exam Fee Through Aadhar Enrollment / Seva Kendra / CSC Center Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 1.71233%;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Aadhar card Facility</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Aadhar Card Enrollment</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Download E Aadhar</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Online Correction</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Find UID and All Services of UIDAI</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 1.71233%;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How to Enrolled with New Aadhar</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Find Your Nearest Enrollment Center to Choose Your State Name, District Name and Area</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Go to Aadhar Card Enrollment Venue and Submit Your Document and Other Related Document Photo, Bio metric Details</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After the Few Days Your E Aadhar is Available on Portal.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 1.71233%;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Online Correction E Aadhar Card</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After the Successfully Generating the Aadhar Card if you See Any Correction in Aadhar Card.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For Any Correction Kindly Use Only Aadhar Card Correction Online or Enrollment Center.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After the Over the Correction Procedure Wait for the Few Days and Download E Aadhar.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 1.71233%;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong> Document Required For New Aadhar Card Enrollment</strong></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.1705%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Photo ID Card</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 74.8295%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Passport, PAN Card, Ration/ PDS Photo Card, Voter ID, Driving License Etc.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.1705%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Address Proof</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 74.8295%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Passport, Bank Statement/ Passbook, Post Office Account Statement/ Passbook , Ration Card ,Voter ID ,Driving License, Government Photo ID cards/ service photo identity card issued by PSU . Electricity Bill (not older than 3 months) , Water Bill (not older than 3 months) . Telephone Landline Bill (not older than 3 months), Property Tax Receipt (not older than 1 year) Etc.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.1705%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 74.8295%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Birth Certificate, SSLC Book / Certificate, Passport, Photo ID card having Date of Birth, PAN Card, Marksheet, Etc.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 1.71233%;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How to Download E Aadhar Card</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In order to print, verify or correct the Aadhar card, the applicant should open the official website of UIDAI.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Here the candidates will have to click on the useful link as per their requirements.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Applicants can get the electronic version of Aadhar Card by entering the Enrolment ID received at the time of enrolment in the registered mobile number.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Applicants who have enrolled for Aadhar Card can check their Aadhar generation status by providing the enrolment ID and their Date of Birth.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In order to get Online 